WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.374 --> 00:00:05.528
- Everyone in the world
has gone to bed one night

00:00:05.528 --> 00:00:09.695
or another with fear, or pain,
or loss or disappointment.

00:00:11.646 --> 00:00:14.896
And yet each of us has awakened arisen.

00:00:15.765 --> 00:00:19.087
Somehow made our ablutions
in other human beings

00:00:19.087 --> 00:00:20.763
and said morning how are yah?

00:00:20.763 --> 00:00:22.880
Fine thanks and you?

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:26.328
It's amazing wherever that
abinds in the human being

00:00:26.328 --> 00:00:30.236
there is the nobleness
of the human spirit.

00:00:30.236 --> 00:00:34.056
Despite it all, black and
white, Asians, Spanish,

00:00:34.056 --> 00:00:37.556
Native American, pretty, plain, thin, fat,

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:44.180
vowed or celibate, we rise.

00:00:44.180 --> 00:00:46.680
(light music)

00:00:50.789 --> 00:00:53.248
You may write me down in history,

00:00:53.248 --> 00:00:55.598
with your bitter twisted lies.

00:00:55.598 --> 00:00:58.379
You may trod me in the very dirt

00:00:58.379 --> 00:01:00.962
but still like dust, I'll rise.

00:01:02.603 --> 00:01:05.378
- Does my sassiness upset you?

00:01:05.378 --> 00:01:07.642
Why are you beset with gloom?

00:01:07.642 --> 00:01:10.227
Cause I walk like I've got oil wells

00:01:10.227 --> 00:01:12.217
pumping in my living room.

00:01:12.217 --> 00:01:15.381
- Just like moons and the suns,
with the certainty of tides,

00:01:15.381 --> 00:01:19.422
just like hopes and
springing high, still I rise.

00:01:19.422 --> 00:01:21.813
- Did you want to see me broken?

00:01:21.813 --> 00:01:24.541
Bowed head and lowered eyes?

00:01:24.541 --> 00:01:27.686
Shoulders falling down like teardrops,

00:01:27.686 --> 00:01:30.659
weakened by my soulful cries?

00:01:30.659 --> 00:01:33.044
- Does my haughtiness offend you?

00:01:33.044 --> 00:01:35.545
Don't you take it awful hard,

00:01:35.545 --> 00:01:38.390
cause I laugh like I've got gold mines

00:01:38.390 --> 00:01:40.758
digging in my own backyard.

00:01:40.758 --> 00:01:42.982
- You can shoot me with your words,

00:01:42.982 --> 00:01:45.352
you can cut me with your lies,

00:01:45.352 --> 00:01:47.559
you can kill me with your hatefulness,

00:01:47.559 --> 00:01:50.059
but just like life, I'll rise.

00:01:50.926 --> 00:01:53.282
- Does my sexiness upset you?

00:01:53.282 --> 00:01:55.457
Does it come as a surprise?

00:01:55.457 --> 00:01:58.139
That I dance like I've got diamonds

00:01:58.139 --> 00:02:00.472
at the meeting of my thighs?

00:02:01.798 --> 00:02:04.770
- Out of the huts of
history's shame, I rise.

00:02:04.770 --> 00:02:09.148
- Up from a past that's
rooted rooted in pain, I rise.

00:02:09.148 --> 00:02:11.842
I'm a black ocean, leaping and wide.

00:02:11.842 --> 00:02:14.465
Welling and swelling I bear in the tide.

00:02:14.465 --> 00:02:18.855
Leaving behind nights of
terror and fear, I rise.

00:02:18.855 --> 00:02:22.452
- Into a daybreak miraculously clear,

00:02:22.452 --> 00:02:23.639
I rise.

00:02:23.639 --> 00:02:27.925
- Bringing the gifts that
my ancestors gave, I rise.

00:02:27.925 --> 00:02:31.425
- I am the hope and the dream of the slave

00:02:32.631 --> 00:02:35.548
and so (clapping).

00:02:37.101 --> 00:02:38.601
There I go rising.

00:02:39.789 --> 00:02:42.372
(light music)

